# tramadol.msf
# Tramadol  pKa=9.410 (dimethylammonium→amine, q=+1→0)
# Source: Avdeef 2001
# Centrally acting opioid/SNRI. Tertiary dimethylamine on cyclohexane.
# Unique: the aryl-OMe group on the cyclohexyl ring is 4 bonds from N;
# yet pKa=9.41 is distinctly lower than simple dimethylamine (10.87).
# The electron-withdrawing aryl-O effect propagates inductively to N.
# Tests remote inductive effects on cyclic tertiary amines.

